msgid "⟪k:0⟫The tea she had made for her husband was forming a stain in the carpet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫The tea she had made for her husband was forming a stain in the carpet."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D9217328_537E_44AE_A7D1_F2142D1419F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23865d711f14686946dd8945c0d501bef24cf26a639bbe22fe7e03ca59e2b844
