msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But even the broken cup seemed to have no concern to spare for her. Its shattered edge cut "
"her fingertip when she made to pick it up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫But even the broken cup seemed to have no concern to spare for her. Its shattered edge cut "
"her fingertip when she made to pick it up."

